TFLV_Upgrade_RS_HordeChaingunner_TT = "The other way to spend a kill: instead of one good body, a ring of cheap ones. Levels buy more of them rather than better ones, and they come up spread around the corpse so they do not crowd each other out. Same rules as any minion -- friendly to you, hostile to everything else, and paying XP to the gun that raised them for life. Mastery: five at a time.";

