TFLV_Upgrade_RS_BrandImpact_Name = "Brand: Impact";
TFLV_Upgrade_RS_BrandImpact_Desc = "your hits plant impact where they land";
TFLV_Upgrade_RS_BrandImpact_TT = "Hits have a growing chance to leave a impact payload at the impact. What actually gets planted is drawn live from the FX registry, so it is never quite the same twice and it grows on its own as impact effects are added to the mod -- import a weapon set, tag its parts, and every Impact card gets deeper without a line of code. Mastery: it plants the headline version, the big one.";

TFLV_Upgrade_RS_AttuneImpact_Name = "Attune: Impact";
TFLV_Upgrade_RS_AttuneImpact_Desc = "your gun works a impact beat into its firing cycle";
TFLV_Upgrade_RS_AttuneImpact_TT = "Locks an extra beat into the weapon's firing rotation built entirely from impact parts -- projectile, muzzle, smoke, sparks, trail and impact all drawn from that theme together, so it arrives as a coherent shot rather than a recolour. Levels tighten the rotation from every fifth shot down to every second. Mastery: a second, independently rolled impact beat joins the same cycle, so the theme shows up two different ways.";

TFLV_Upgrade_RS_SurgeImpact_Name = "Surge: Impact";
TFLV_Upgrade_RS_SurgeImpact_Desc = "kills burst into impact";
TFLV_Upgrade_RS_SurgeImpact_TT = "A kill has a chance to throw the biggest impact effect the registry holds. Purely on death, so it never interferes with your shot, and it scales with whatever impact content the mod has loaded. Mastery: three at once, thrown apart.";

TFLV_Upgrade_RS_FlourishProjectile_Name = "Flourish: Projectile";
TFLV_Upgrade_RS_FlourishProjectile_Desc = "your projectile goes big on impact";
TFLV_Upgrade_RS_FlourishProjectile_TT = "Every hit has a chance to draw the headline entry from the projectile axis -- the oversized version, the one meant to read as an event rather than a detail. It pulls from the registry, so it covers every projectile actor the mod has and picks up new ones automatically. Mastery: it will also draw the entries that spawn further effects.";

TFLV_Upgrade_RS_EchoProjectile_Name = "Echo: Projectile";
TFLV_Upgrade_RS_EchoProjectile_Desc = "kills repeat your projectile, scattered";
TFLV_Upgrade_RS_EchoProjectile_TT = "A kill throws extra projectile around the corpse, up to four at higher levels, scattered rather than stacked. Drawn from the whole projectile axis rather than a fixed choice, so the same card looks different on every weapon and every theme. Mastery: it stops filtering out the effects that spawn more effects.";

